igned groups, or a shift among rural voters back toward Husted, could close the polling gap.", "confidence": "medium", "notes": ["Incumbent Jon Husted (R) is running."]}, "overview": "Ohio's special Senate race pits appointed Republican incumbent Jon Husted against former Senator Sherrod Brown in one of 2026's most expensive contests. Polls since early October consistently show Brown ahead, with most surveys giving him a three-to-seven point lead, including some from Republican-leaning pollsters. Prediction markets price Brown's chances near 69%, and most expert raters call the race a Tossup, with a few rating it Lean D for a flip.\n\nHusted benefits from incumbency, the state's Republican lean, and heavy outside support from Trump and Musk-aligned groups, while Brown has outraised him substantially but faces sustained crypto-industry opposition spending. The combination of a steady polling edge and market pricing points to a narrow Democratic advantage in a race that remains genuinely competitive.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7221, "margin": 2.94}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7246, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6986, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7024, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.6349, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6393, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6851, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7568, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.7432, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7463, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.7417, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.7438, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.7437, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6872, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6759, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6875, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.716, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09